IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXEMV.

*> EMVCo Merchant-Presented-Mode QR payload codec (TLV + CRC16 CCITT-FALSE).
*>
*> External dependency: EMVCo "EMV QR Code Specification for Payment
*> Applications - Merchant-Presented Mode" plus the BCB Pix QR Code
*> technical specification.  Tag identifiers follow the structure those
*> documents describe; the version in force must be re-checked before
*> production use.  Nothing here is asserted to be regulatory truth.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I PIC 9(04).
01 WS-XI PIC 9(04).
01 WS-BUF PIC X(500).
01 WS-LEN PIC 9(04).
01 WS-IDX PIC 9(04).
01 WS-NEED PIC 9(04).
01 WS-BODY PIC 9(04).
01 WS-TAGS PIC 9(04).
01 WS-TAG PIC X(02).
01 WS-TL PIC X(02).
01 WS-TLEN PIC 9(04).
01 WS-TV PIC X(100).
01 WS-CANDIDATE PIC X(500).
01 WS-OUTER PIC X(500).
01 WS-INNER PIC X(200).
01 WS-UNPARSED PIC X(120).
01 WS-IIDX PIC 9(04).
01 WS-ITAG PIC X(02).
01 WS-ITL PIC X(02).
01 WS-ITLEN PIC 9(04).
01 WS-INEED PIC 9(04).
01 WS-IV PIC X(60).
01 WS-ACCUM PIC 9(05).
01 WS-OTHER PIC 9(05).
01 WS-RES PIC 9(05).
01 WS-Q PIC 9(07).
01 WS-R PIC 9(05).
01 WS-BYTE PIC 9(03).
01 WS-BITNO PIC 9(01).
01 WS-ILEN PIC 9(04).
01 WS-TMPVAL PIC 9(05).
01 WS-REMN PIC 9(02).
01 WS-OFFSET PIC 9(04).
01 WS-W PIC 9(05).
01 WS-ED4 PIC X(04).
01 WS-BT.
   05 WS-BT-TAG PIC X(02).
   05 WS-BT-VAL PIC X(100).
   05 WS-BT-LEN PIC 9(02).
   05 WS-BT-TARGET PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BPXEMVP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-PX-EMV.
    MOVE "00" TO EM-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO EM-MSG
    EVALUATE EM-MODE
        WHEN "PARSE" PERFORM DO-PARSE
        WHEN "BUILD" PERFORM DO-BUILD
        WHEN "CRC" PERFORM DO-CRC
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO EM-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN EMV MODE" TO EM-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DO-CRC.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(EM-IN) TO WS-CANDIDATE
    PERFORM COMPUTE-CRC
    MOVE SPACES TO EM-OUT
    MOVE WS-ED4 TO EM-CRC-CALC
    MOVE WS-ED4 TO EM-OUT.

DO-BUILD.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OUTER WS-INNER
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "00" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE "01" TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    PERFORM BUILD-PIX-INNER
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "26" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE WS-INNER TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "52" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-MCC TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "53" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-CURRENCY TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    IF EM-AMOUNT NOT = SPACES
        MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
        MOVE "54" TO WS-BT-TAG
        MOVE EM-AMOUNT TO WS-BT-VAL
        PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    END-IF
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "58" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-COUNTRY TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "59" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-NAME TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "60" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-CITY TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    IF EM-ADDL-TXID NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM BUILD-ADDL-INNER
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUTER) TO WS-CANDIDATE
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CANDIDATE)) TO WS-LEN
    STRING WS-CANDIDATE(1:WS-LEN) DELIMITED SIZE "6304"
        DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-CANDIDATE(1:WS-LEN + 4)
    END-STRING
    ADD 4 TO WS-LEN
    PERFORM COMPUTE-CRC
    MOVE WS-ED4 TO EM-CRC-CALC
    MOVE SPACES TO EM-OUT
    STRING WS-CANDIDATE(1:WS-LEN) DELIMITED SIZE WS-ED4
        DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO EM-OUT
    END-STRING.

BUILD-PIX-INNER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-INNER
    MOVE "I" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "00" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-GUID TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "I" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "01" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-KEY TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    IF EM-TXID NOT = SPACES
        MOVE "I" TO WS-BT-TARGET
        MOVE "02" TO WS-BT-TAG
        MOVE EM-TXID TO WS-BT-VAL
        PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    END-IF.

BUILD-ADDL-INNER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-INNER
    MOVE "I" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "05" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE EM-ADDL-TXID TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV
    MOVE "O" TO WS-BT-TARGET
    MOVE "62" TO WS-BT-TAG
    MOVE WS-INNER TO WS-BT-VAL
    PERFORM EMIT-TLV.

EMIT-TLV.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-BT-VAL) TO WS-TV
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TV)) TO WS-BT-LEN
    IF WS-BT-LEN = 0
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF WS-BT-LEN > 99
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "EMV TAG VALUE TOO LONG" TO EM-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TAG
    MOVE WS-BT-TAG TO WS-TAG
    IF WS-BT-TARGET = "O"
        COMPUTE WS-OFFSET = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUTER))
            + 1
        STRING WS-TAG DELIMITED SIZE WS-BT-LEN DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TV) DELIMITED SIZE
            INTO WS-OUTER(WS-OFFSET:)
        END-STRING
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-OFFSET = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INNER))
            + 1
        STRING WS-TAG DELIMITED SIZE WS-BT-LEN DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TV) DELIMITED SIZE
            INTO WS-INNER(WS-OFFSET:)
        END-STRING
    END-IF.

DO-PARSE.
    MOVE SPACES TO EM-FPI EM-MAI EM-GUID EM-KEY EM-TXID EM-MCC
        EM-CURRENCY EM-AMOUNT EM-COUNTRY EM-NAME EM-CITY EM-LANGS
        EM-ADDL-TXID EM-TIP-PCT EM-TIP-FIX EM-UNPARSED EM-CRC
        WS-UNPARSED
    MOVE "N" TO EM-CRC-OK
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(EM-IN) TO WS-BUF
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(EM-IN)) TO WS-LEN
    IF WS-LEN < 8
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "EMV PAYLOAD TOO SHORT" TO EM-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-BODY = WS-LEN - 4
    COMPUTE WS-TAGS = WS-LEN
    MOVE WS-BUF(WS-BODY + 1:4) TO EM-CRC
    MOVE WS-BUF(1:WS-BODY) TO WS-CANDIDATE
    PERFORM COMPUTE-CRC
    IF WS-ED4 NOT = FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(EM-CRC)
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "INVALID PAYLOAD CRC" TO EM-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO EM-CRC-OK
    MOVE 1 TO WS-IDX
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-TAGS - 3
        MOVE WS-BUF(WS-IDX:2) TO WS-TAG
        MOVE WS-BUF(WS-IDX + 2:2) TO WS-TL
        PERFORM CHECK-LENGTH-FIELD
        IF EM-RC NOT = "00"
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TL) TO WS-TLEN
        COMPUTE WS-NEED = WS-IDX + 4 + WS-TLEN - 1
        IF WS-NEED > WS-TAGS
            MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
            MOVE "TRUNCATED EMV PAYLOAD" TO EM-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE WS-BUF(WS-IDX + 4:WS-TLEN) TO WS-TV
        PERFORM STORE-TAG
        IF EM-RC NOT = "00"
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        ADD 4 WS-TLEN TO WS-IDX
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-IDX NOT = WS-TAGS + 1
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "TRAILING DATA AFTER LAST TAG" TO EM-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF EM-FPI NOT = "01"
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        IF EM-FPI = SPACES
            MOVE "MISSING PAYLOAD FORMAT INDICATOR" TO EM-MSG
        ELSE
            MOVE "UNSUPPORTED PAYLOAD FORMAT" TO EM-MSG
        END-IF
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-UNPARSED TO EM-UNPARSED
    IF EM-GUID NOT = SPACES AND EM-KEY = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "PIX KEY MISSING FROM ACCOUNT INFO" TO EM-MSG
    END-IF.

CHECK-LENGTH-FIELD.
    IF WS-TL(1:1) < "0" OR WS-TL(1:1) > "9" OR
       WS-TL(2:1) < "0" OR WS-TL(2:1) > "9"
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "INVALID TAG LENGTH FIELD" TO EM-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TL) = 0
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "EMPTY TAG LENGTH" TO EM-MSG
    END-IF.

STORE-TAG.
    EVALUATE WS-TAG
        WHEN "00"
            IF WS-TLEN NOT = 2
                MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
                MOVE "INVALID FORMAT INDICATOR LENGTH" TO EM-MSG
                GOBACK
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-TV(1:2) TO EM-FPI
        WHEN "01"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-MAI
        WHEN "26"
            PERFORM PARSE-PIX
        WHEN "51"
            PERFORM PARSE-PIX
            PERFORM NOTE-UNPARSED
        WHEN "52"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-MCC
        WHEN "53"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-CURRENCY
        WHEN "54"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-AMOUNT
        WHEN "58"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-COUNTRY
        WHEN "59"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-NAME
        WHEN "60"
            MOVE WS-TV TO EM-CITY
        WHEN "62"
            PERFORM PARSE-ADDL
        WHEN "63"
            CONTINUE
        WHEN OTHER
            PERFORM NOTE-UNPARSED
    END-EVALUATE.

PARSE-PIX.
    MOVE WS-TV TO WS-INNER
    MOVE WS-TLEN TO WS-ILEN
    MOVE SPACES TO EM-GUID EM-KEY EM-TXID
    MOVE 1 TO WS-IIDX
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-IIDX > WS-ILEN - 3
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX:2) TO WS-ITAG
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX + 2:2) TO WS-ITL
        IF WS-ITL(1:1) < "0" OR WS-ITL(1:1) > "9" OR
           WS-ITL(2:1) < "0" OR WS-ITL(2:1) > "9" OR
           FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-ITL) = 0
            MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
            MOVE "INVALID INNER TAG LENGTH" TO EM-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-ITL) TO WS-ITLEN
        COMPUTE WS-INEED = WS-IIDX + 4 + WS-ITLEN - 1
        IF WS-INEED > WS-ILEN
            MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
            MOVE "TRUNCATED INNER TAG" TO EM-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX + 4:WS-ITLEN) TO WS-IV
        EVALUATE WS-ITAG
            WHEN "00" MOVE WS-IV TO EM-GUID
            WHEN "01" MOVE WS-IV TO EM-KEY
            WHEN "02" MOVE WS-IV TO EM-TXID
            WHEN OTHER CONTINUE
        END-EVALUATE
        ADD 4 WS-ITLEN TO WS-IIDX
    END-PERFORM
    IF EM-GUID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO EM-RC
        MOVE "MERCHANT ACCOUNT GUI MISSING" TO EM-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF.

PARSE-ADDL.
    MOVE WS-TV TO WS-INNER
    MOVE WS-TLEN TO WS-ILEN
    MOVE 1 TO WS-IIDX
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-IIDX > WS-ILEN - 3
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX:2) TO WS-ITAG
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX + 2:2) TO WS-ITL
        IF WS-ITL(1:1) < "0" OR WS-ITL(1:1) > "9" OR
           WS-ITL(2:1) < "0" OR WS-ITL(2:1) > "9" OR
           FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-ITL) = 0
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
        MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-ITL) TO WS-ITLEN
        COMPUTE WS-INEED = WS-IIDX + 4 + WS-ITLEN - 1
        IF WS-INEED > WS-ILEN
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
        MOVE WS-INNER(WS-IIDX + 4:WS-ITLEN) TO WS-IV
        EVALUATE WS-ITAG
            WHEN "05" MOVE WS-IV TO EM-ADDL-TXID
            WHEN "07" MOVE WS-IV TO EM-TIP-PCT
            WHEN OTHER CONTINUE
        END-EVALUATE
        ADD 4 WS-ITLEN TO WS-IIDX
    END-PERFORM.

NOTE-UNPARSED.
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UNPARSED) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
        DELIMITED SIZE WS-TAG DELIMITED SIZE "=" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TV) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-UNPARSED
    END-STRING.

COMPUTE-CRC.
    MOVE 65535 TO WS-ACCUM
    MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CANDIDATE)) TO WS-LEN
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-LEN
        MOVE FUNCTION ORD(WS-CANDIDATE(WS-I:1)) TO WS-BYTE
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-BYTE
        COMPUTE WS-OTHER = WS-BYTE * 256
        PERFORM DO-XOR
        PERFORM VARYING WS-BITNO FROM 1 BY 1
            UNTIL WS-BITNO > 8
            IF WS-ACCUM > 32767
                COMPUTE WS-ACCUM = WS-ACCUM * 2 - 65536
                MOVE 4129 TO WS-OTHER
                PERFORM DO-XOR
            ELSE
                COMPUTE WS-ACCUM = WS-ACCUM * 2
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM FORMAT-HEX.

DO-XOR.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-RES
    MOVE 1 TO WS-W
    PERFORM VARYING WS-XI FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-XI > 16
        DIVIDE WS-ACCUM BY WS-W GIVING WS-Q REMAINDER WS-R
        MOVE FUNCTION MOD(WS-Q 2) TO WS-BYTE
        DIVIDE WS-OTHER BY WS-W GIVING WS-Q REMAINDER WS-R
        IF FUNCTION MOD(WS-Q 2) NOT = WS-BYTE
            ADD WS-W TO WS-RES
        END-IF
        MULTIPLY WS-W BY 2 GIVING WS-W
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-RES TO WS-ACCUM.

FORMAT-HEX.
    MOVE WS-ACCUM TO WS-TMPVAL
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ED4
    PERFORM VARYING WS-XI FROM 4 BY -1 UNTIL WS-XI < 1
        DIVIDE WS-TMPVAL BY 16 GIVING WS-TMPVAL
            REMAINDER WS-REMN
        IF WS-REMN < 10
            ADD 49 TO WS-REMN
        ELSE
            ADD 56 TO WS-REMN
        END-IF
        MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(WS-REMN) TO WS-ED4(WS-XI:1)
    END-PERFORM.
